{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King Richard has been captured. You've been sent to deliver a message to the King's allies in England, but upon returning from the Third Crusade, you\u2019re captured by the wicked thugs of Prince John, who usurped the throne. And now, they know King Richard yet lives. Prove yourself as loyal to the true king by thwarting Prince John. Skulk through the dungeons of Nottingham Castle, uncovering its secrets, or fight the enemies of King Richard head-on. Your actions will shape the fate of Nottingham forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight the enemies of the true king</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/4286e406f80b58162c0df283552b938d.poster.avif?t=1751470762\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/4286e406f80b58162c0df283552b938d.webm?t=1751470762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/4286e406f80b58162c0df283552b938d.mp4?t=1751470762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The king has vanished, and Prince John\u2019s evil allies have taken up positions of power, left vacant by those who took up the cross and sailed for the Holy Land. But to unravel the truth behind Prince John\u2019s usurpation, you\u2019ll need to defeat his wicked servants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hide in the Shadows</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/254edcc4f6077cb3e5e5a063646c7f31.poster.avif?t=1751470762\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/254edcc4f6077cb3e5e5a063646c7f31.webm?t=1751470762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/254edcc4f6077cb3e5e5a063646c7f31.mp4?t=1751470762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of immersive stealth mechanics. Enemies will struggle to find you in dark areas, and won\u2019t be able to hear you as easily when you crouch. On the other hand, showing yourself and making noise will guarantee danger will find you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master melee and archery combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/bc58d23c9b0d4c3294b017efd9a156fb.poster.avif?t=1751470762\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/bc58d23c9b0d4c3294b017efd9a156fb.webm?t=1751470762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/bc58d23c9b0d4c3294b017efd9a156fb.mp4?t=1751470762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robin hood isn't just a master of the bow, he is also an excellent swordsman. Get the drop on your enemies from a distance, or, if shadows fail you, thwart your foes in close-quarters combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remove Prince John's resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/3e361f114e9fe3f7abd7f685f7dec582.poster.avif?t=1751470762\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/3e361f114e9fe3f7abd7f685f7dec582.webm?t=1751470762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/3e361f114e9fe3f7abd7f685f7dec582.mp4?t=1751470762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stolen treasures fill Nottingham Castle. Reclaim as many of them as you can and bring them to Little John in exchange for supplies and healing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight or sneak through an open-ended, short, sandbox dungeon as the heroic outlaw Robin Hood </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic stealth mechanics including using shadows to remain concealed, and sneaking to remain unheard </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply personal story with a strong cast of characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of stealth games looking for a short sandbox experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a solo developer</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2884700?t=1751470762","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2884700?t=1751470762","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/2d3d219af23e7bee9ae7734e53b599f244100a8d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751470762","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/2d3d219af23e7bee9ae7734e53b599f244100a8d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751470762","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains violence in the form of medieval sword combat and archery."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3780900,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King Richard has been captured. You've been sent to deliver a message to the King's allies in England, but upon returning from the Third Crusade, you\u2019re captured by the wicked thugs of Prince John, who usurped the throne. And now, they know King Richard yet lives. Prove yourself as loyal to the true king by thwarting Prince John. Skulk through the dungeons of Nottingham Castle, uncovering its secrets, or fight the enemies of King Richard head-on. Your actions will shape the fate of Nottingham forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight the enemies of the true king</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/4286e406f80b58162c0df283552b938d.poster.avif?t=1751470762\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/4286e406f80b58162c0df283552b938d.webm?t=1751470762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/4286e406f80b58162c0df283552b938d.mp4?t=1751470762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The king has vanished, and Prince John\u2019s evil allies have taken up positions of power, left vacant by those who took up the cross and sailed for the Holy Land. But to unravel the truth behind Prince John\u2019s usurpation, you\u2019ll need to defeat his wicked servants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hide in the Shadows</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/254edcc4f6077cb3e5e5a063646c7f31.poster.avif?t=1751470762\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/254edcc4f6077cb3e5e5a063646c7f31.webm?t=1751470762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/254edcc4f6077cb3e5e5a063646c7f31.mp4?t=1751470762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of immersive stealth mechanics. Enemies will struggle to find you in dark areas, and won\u2019t be able to hear you as easily when you crouch. On the other hand, showing yourself and making noise will guarantee danger will find you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master melee and archery combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/bc58d23c9b0d4c3294b017efd9a156fb.poster.avif?t=1751470762\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/bc58d23c9b0d4c3294b017efd9a156fb.webm?t=1751470762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/bc58d23c9b0d4c3294b017efd9a156fb.mp4?t=1751470762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robin hood isn't just a master of the bow, he is also an excellent swordsman. Get the drop on your enemies from a distance, or, if shadows fail you, thwart your foes in close-quarters combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remove Prince John's resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/3e361f114e9fe3f7abd7f685f7dec582.poster.avif?t=1751470762\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/3e361f114e9fe3f7abd7f685f7dec582.webm?t=1751470762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/extras/3e361f114e9fe3f7abd7f685f7dec582.mp4?t=1751470762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stolen treasures fill Nottingham Castle. Reclaim as many of them as you can and bring them to Little John in exchange for supplies and healing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight or sneak through an open-ended, short, sandbox dungeon as the heroic outlaw Robin Hood </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic stealth mechanics including using shadows to remain concealed, and sneaking to remain unheard </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply personal story with a strong cast of characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of stealth games looking for a short sandbox experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a solo developer</p></li></ul>","developers":["Judica Me Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884700/8fb0ea9bd1a40fb528acf5b131471d3b6554c036/header.jpg?t=1751470762","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2884700/24201752/2202dbd4168fe073e8667761b57d53173b618896/1750439889/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750441219","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2884700/24201752/2202dbd4168fe073e8667761b57d53173b618896/1750439889/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750441219","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.